Subtask 2.2: Set Up Traffic Generation
Step 8: Create a traffic generator to simulate user requests

Create a file called traffic-generator.yaml:

apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: traffic-generator
  namespace: traffic-mirror-lab
spec:
  replicas: 1
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: traffic-generator
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: traffic-generator
    spec:
      containers:
      - name: traffic-generator
        image: curlimages/curl:latest
        command: ["/bin/sh"]
        args:
        - -c
        - |
          while true; do
            echo "Sending request at $(date)"
            curl -s -o /dev/null -w "Status: %{http_code}, Time: %{time_total}s\n" \
              http://istio-ingressgateway.istio-system.svc.cluster.local/productpage
            sleep 5
          done
        resources:
          requests:
            memory: "64Mi"
            cpu: "50m"
          limits:
            memory: "128Mi"
            cpu: "100m"
Deploy the traffic generator:

