Subtask 3.2: Create Custom Metrics for Traffic Analysis
Step 12: Configure custom metrics to track mirrored traffic

Create a file called telemetry-config.yaml:

apiVersion: telemetry.istio.io/v1alpha1
kind: Telemetry
metadata:
  name: mirror-metrics
  namespace: traffic-mirror-lab
spec:
  metrics:
  - providers:
    - name: prometheus
  - overrides:
    - match:
        metric: ALL_METRICS
      tagOverrides:
        destination_version:
          value: "%{RESPONSE_FLAGS}"
        mirror_status:
          value: |
            has(request.headers['x-envoy-original-dst-host']) ? "mirrored" : "original"
Apply the telemetry configuration:

